00:01:08.076 --> 00:01:11.036
We have a methane problem from cows.

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:14.356
So how can you reduce these methane burps?

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:17.756
My colleagues and I
may have found a solution.

00:01:18.116 --> 00:01:19.276
Seaweed!

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:21.196
Let me explain.

00:01:21.516 --> 00:01:23.116
A couple of years ago,

00:01:23.156 --> 00:01:25.716
an article was published
by Rob Kinley and colleagues

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:30.236
that showed almost complete
elimination of methane